  m_Name: Text_QuarryWorker_SouthFace_4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Night watch on the quarry is one guard and a brazier, and the guard's usually asleep before the brazier is, so it wouldn't have been hard for him. Then one morning there's a door in the crack, Company timber with an iron lock, put up while we slept. And Odo's bedroll was cold.
